<title>USA: TABLE - Eskimo Pie Corp Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Eskimo Pie Corp Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.29		    $0.49</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.29		     0.47</p>
<p> Net		 1,013		    1,694</p>
<p> Revs		23,837		   25,324</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary3,458		    3,472</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted3,620		    3,634</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.31		    $0.80</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.31		     0.77</p>
<p> Net		 1,066		    2,765</p>
<p> Revs		41,915		   45,093</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary3,454		    3,474</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted3,617		    3,636</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Decline in first-half 1997 sales due in part to repeat sales of Nabisco Brand products not meeting expectations.</p>
<p>1997 results also hurt by cold, wet spring hampering demand for ice cream novelties.</p>
</text>
